  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1705.03 Application Review. The department shall review applications to certify wood ash for distribution and use as specified in Env-Sw 304.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1700); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3405.03); ss by #10601; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
